<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MacMenuBar.com (中文)</title><link>https://macmenubar.com</link><description>精心整理的 1700+ 款 Mac 菜单栏应用目录</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:33:22 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>小月亮</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/lilmoon/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LilMoon-2.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="LilMoon" height="579" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LilMoon-2.webp" width="400"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
